# Episode 6 ending "From Below", ~50 s + the title (docs/design/script-episodes-4-8/e6m4.md, shot list X1-X7; beats from
# docs/design/mission-e6-04.md Cinematic hooks `ep6_ending`, D3; campaign-outline.md 3.6; prologue-3min.md S07). Under
# the earth: amber veins, a vast dark hollow; the crack in the rock ceiling (the orrery floor from beneath) splits open
# and the Master steps down a stair of light (Obren: "You came down yourself. I knew you would."); he pulls the crack
# shut like a door; above, the orrery stops, the empty robe falls, the regalia burst; four streaks leave the dome for
# the four horizons and every dragon turns its head; the title card.
# Text source for i18n / voices: data/voice/lines/ep6_ending.json (the same text as the lines below). Obren speaks
# through the Whisper voice (cast.json alias), hidden capsule `obren`.
# e6m4 is not built: not in CampaignState.STORY_FILMS yet (play it with run_cine.ps1 play ep6_ending).
# Sets (stand-ins): forge_ep3_memories' hollow (x 34: the Hollow and its heart-stone, Malrik's Ep3 memory) for "under
# the earth" (no rock-shaft set exists); forge_citadel (the orrery dome, the citadel at night: its S03 / S04 marks under
# a night grade). The stair of light = a sun_pillar fx; the Master = the forge_ep3_memories light figure.
# Axis: under the earth every camera stays south (+Z) of the Master's stair; the dome = the prologue S07 rule.
cine ep6_ending  title="Episode 6: The Lake and the Seed"  letterbox=2.39  seed=606  length=48..53
use set forge_ep3_memories
use music res://assets/audio/forge/music/ep3_opening.wav  vol=-20
cast  narrator  capsule  at=(0, 0, -300)  hidden=1  speaker=narrator
cast  obren     capsule  at=(4, 0, -300)  hidden=1  speaker=obren
cast  lord      res://art/cinematics/stage_sets/forge_ep3_memories/props/master.tscn  at=(34.7, 4.2, 1.0)  yaw=20  set=forge_ep3_memories  hidden=1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- under the earth
# Crane down through black rock: amber veins; far below, a vast dark hollow; far above, one hairline crack of light
shot X1 8.0  cam=crane  from=(34.6, 12, 7.0)  to=(34.4, 3.2, 4.4)  look=(34, 0.6, 0)>(34.1, 0.8, -0.2)  fov=50>44  in=fade_black:1.5
  at 0.0  fade color=#1a0c04  alpha=0.35  time=0.05
  at 0.0  hide m_malrik
  at 0.0  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/stone_thump.wav  vol=-18
  at 2.0  vfx crack  scene=res://art/cinematics/fx/sun_pillar.tscn  at=(34.7, 6.0, 1.0)  life=6.0  scale=0.08
# Low, from below, looking up: the crack splits open in white-gold light; the Master steps down onto a stair of light
shot X2 7.0  cam=crane  from=(36.3, 2.2, 5.4)  to=(36.1, 1.9, 5.0)  look=(34.6, 5.4, 0.8)>(34.5, 3.6, 0.7)  fov=50  faces=lord
  at 0.0  show lord
  at 0.0  vfx stair  scene=res://art/cinematics/fx/sun_pillar.tscn  at=(34.7, 0, -0.2)  life=22.0  scale=0.12
  at 0.0  move lord  to=(34.7, 1.4, 1.0)  speed=0.5
  at 0.6  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/obren_whisper.wav  vol=-8
  at 1.0  line obren "You came down yourself. I knew you would."  dur=4.0
  at 1.2  vfx pulse  scene=res://art/cinematics/stage_sets/forge_ep3_memories/props/heart_pulse.tscn  at=(34.02, 0.6, -0.04)  life=3.0  scale=0.8
# MS the Master on the stair, 3/4-left, low: he looks down into the amber dark, then up, once
shot X3 8.0  cam=static  from=(36.5, 2.6, 4.0)  look=(34.7, 3.75, 1.0)  fov=44  faces=lord
  at 0.0  teleport lord  to=(34.7, 1.4, 1.0)  yaw=30
  at 0.8  line master "Then we will both learn patience, Obren. I have had a good teacher."  dur=5.8
  at 4.6  face lord  yaw=10  time=1.0
# CU, reaching up: he pulls the crack shut behind him like a door; the seam seals, the light pinches out
shot X4 7.0  cam=static  from=(36.1, 4.3, 3.4)  look=(34.7, 4.05, 1.0)  fov=36  faces=lord
  at 1.4  line master "Then, between one breath and the next, he was gone."  dur=4.7
  at 2.0  vfx seal  scene=res://art/cinematics/fx/regalia_burst.tscn  at=(34.7, 4.6, 1.0)  life=1.2  scale=0.2
  at 3.2  fade color=#000000  alpha=0.6  time=1.2

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- above: the orrery
# Static from the orrery floor, looking up: the orrery stops, the empty robe falls, the regalia burst through the dome
shot X5 7.0  set=forge_citadel  cam=static  from=(-11.5, 48.4, 0.5)  look=(-13, 53.2, -5)  fov=56  in=fade_black:0.4
  at 0.0  fade color=#0b0c26  alpha=0.3  time=0.05
  at 0.0  hide lord
  at 0.0  vfx flames2 scene=res://art/cinematics/fx/four_flames.tscn at=(-13, 53, -5) life=1.9 scale=2.5
  at 1.8  vfx regalia scene=res://art/cinematics/fx/regalia_burst.tscn at=(-13, 53, -5) life=2.0 scale=0.45
  at 1.9  hide master
  at 2.4  sfx res://assets/audio/sfx/atk_storm.wav  vol=-14
# Wide, the citadel at night: four streaks shoot out of the dome to the four horizons; every dragon turns its head
shot X6 7.0  set=forge_citadel  cam=static  from=(52, 62, 150)  look=(0, 64, 0)  fov=40
  at 0.0  fade color=#0b0c26  alpha=0.45  time=0.05
  at 0.6  line narrator "Two of the four knew where he had gone. For twelve years, they told no one."  dur=5.6
  at 0.4  vfx red scene=res://art/cinematics/fx/streak_red.tscn at=(-13, 53, -5) to=(40, 160, 200) life=2.8 scale=0.8
  at 0.5  vfx violet scene=res://art/cinematics/fx/streak_violet.tscn at=(-13, 53, -5) to=(200, 160, -40) life=2.7 scale=0.8
  at 0.6  vfx blue scene=res://art/cinematics/fx/streak_blue.tscn at=(-13, 53, -5) to=(-40, 160, -200) life=2.6 scale=0.8
  at 0.7  vfx green scene=res://art/cinematics/fx/streak_green.tscn at=(-13, 53, -5) to=(-200, 160, 40) life=2.5 scale=0.8
# Crane out after the blue and green streaks as they part north and west; the title
shot X7 6.0  set=forge_citadel  cam=crane  from=(58, 96, 62)  to=(24, 110, 34)  look=(0, 86, 0)>(-60, 100, -60)  fov=42>52
  at 0.0  fade color=#0b0c26  alpha=0.45  time=0.05
  at 0.0  vfx blue2 scene=res://art/cinematics/fx/streak_blue.tscn at=(-13, 60, -5) to=(-40, 160, -200) life=3.0 scale=0.8
  at 0.1  vfx green2 scene=res://art/cinematics/fx/streak_green.tscn at=(-13, 60, -5) to=(-200, 160, 40) life=3.0 scale=0.8
  at 1.0  title "Episode 6" sub="The Lake and the Seed" time=3.8
  at 5.0  fade color=#000000 alpha=1 time=1.0
